    ('admin.analytics.metrics.lead', 'zh-CN', '「浏览数」是页面打开次数（PV）；「独立访客」按匿名标识去重（UV）—— 匿名标识由客户端派生、服务端再加盐哈希后落库，库里既没有 IP 明文，也没有原始 cookie 值。日期按 ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/analytics.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.analytics.metrics.lead', 'en-US', '"Page views" counts page opens (PV); "unique visitors" are deduplicated by an anonymous id (UV) — the id is derived on the client and salted and hashed on the server before it is stored, so the database holds neither plain IP addresses nor raw cookie values. Dates are split by the ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/analytics.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.analytics.metrics.strong', 'zh-CN', 'UTC 日界', 200, 'admin', 'admin/analytics.html', 1, now(), now()),
