    ('admin.masterdata.intro1.after', 'zh-CN', '：谁在什么时候把哪条主数据的哪个字段从什么改成了什么（商品 / 变体 / 货源）。一次写操作改了几个字段就是几条记录，新增与删除同样逐字段落行。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.masterdata.intro1.after', 'en-US', ': who changed which field of which master-data record, from what to what (products / variants / sources). One write that touches several fields produces several rows, and inserts and deletes are recorded field by field too.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.masterdata.intro1.lead', 'zh-CN', '这张表记的是', 200, 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.masterdata.intro1.lead', 'en-US', 'Each row records a ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.masterdata.intro1.strong', 'zh-CN', '配置变更', 200, 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.masterdata.intro1.strong', 'en-US', 'configuration change', 200, 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.masterdata.intro2.after1', 'zh-CN', '分工不同：流水记「库存数量怎么变的」（入库 / 出库 / 盘点），本表记「主数据字段怎么变的」。同一次采购收货会同时出现在两处 —— 流水里是「+10」，这里是「成本价 12.00 → 13.50」，回答的是两个问题。记录一旦写入', 200, 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.masterdata.intro2.after1', 'en-US', ': the ledger tracks how stock quantities changed (receipts / issues / counts), while this table tracks how master-data fields changed. The same purchase receipt shows up in both — the ledger says "+10", this table says "cost price 12.00 → 13.50", answering two different questions. Once written, a record is ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.masterdata.intro2.lead', 'zh-CN', '它与', 200, 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.masterdata.intro2.lead', 'en-US', 'It plays a different role from the ', 200, 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.masterdata.intro2.strong1', 'zh-CN', '库存流水', 200, 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.masterdata.intro2.strong1', 'en-US', 'stock ledger', 200, 'admin', 'admin/masterdata_changes.html', 1, now(), now()),
